@startuml
title Register repository names - code
package "src/server/workflow" {
  class "workflow-config.mjs" as Config <<module>>
  class "repository-names.mjs" as Names <<new module>> {
    + checkRepositoryName()
    + repositoryId()
  }
  class "record-store.mjs" as Store <<module>>
  class "verification.mjs" as Verification <<module>>
}
package "src/server" {
  class "mcp.mjs" as Mcp <<module>>
}
package "src/server/review" {
  class "workspace-model.mjs" as Workspace <<module>>
  class "review-server.mjs" as Review <<module>>
}
Store --> Names : checks before migration and access
Names --> Config : reads Repository
Verification --> Names : records the accepted name
Mcp --> Store : takes unnamed warnings
Workspace --> Store : hides refused records
Review --> Store : hides refused records
@enduml
